{"id": 20, "speaker": 27, "form": "dlg", "jp": "「やっぱり、私たちの力ではどうにも‥‥」"},
{"id": 21, "speaker": 46, "form": "dlg", "jp": "「そうですか‥‥」"},
{"id": 22, "speaker": 46, "form": "dlg", "jp": "「やはり、\n　"},
